  "bodyHash": "kEoZkXg8lFw=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。提供大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>可設定額外生物掉落物是一個伺服器端模組，可讓你為任何實體在死亡時添加額外掉落物。首次載入時，它會生成一個設定檔。你可以手動添加物品，或使用遊戲內指令。支援任何帶有 NBT 標籤的物品，例如附魔和寫好的書。也支援模組中的實體，只需確保在新增含有自訂生物的模組時，刪除或重新命名設定檔即可。如果檔案不存在，它會以所有可能的實體類型重新生成。<br><br>生成的設定檔位於 '<em>./config/configurableextramobdrops/</em>'，檔案名稱為 '<em>mobdropconfig.txt</em>'。掉落機率可透過指令設定，或直接在設定檔中修改。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg&w=832\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的自訂套件中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><span><em>/cemd usage</em></span> - 顯示指令的使用方式。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd list</em></span> - 列出所有可在 <em>addhand</em> 和 <em>cleardrops</em> 中使用的實體名稱。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd reload</em></span> - 重新載入對 mobdropconfig 檔案的所有手動修改。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd addhand &lt;實體名稱&gt;</em></span> - 將主手持有的物品添加為指定實體 &lt;實體名稱&gt; 的掉落物，掉落機率為 100%。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd addhand &lt;實體名稱&gt; &lt;掉落機率&gt;</em></span> - 將主手持有的物品添加為指定實體 &lt;實體名稱&gt; 的掉落物，掉落機率介於 0 到 1.0 之間。</span><br><span><span><em>/cemd cleardrops &lt;實體名稱&gt;</em></span> - 清除指定實體 &lt;實體名稱&gt; 的所有額外掉落物。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>所有指令都需要作弊權限。</em></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>/cemd usage</em> 指令：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd list</em> 指令。顯示所有可在 <em>/cemd addhand</em> 和 <em>/cemd cleardrops</em> 中使用的實體名稱。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd addhand &lt;實體名稱&gt;</em> 指令。將生怪蛋（豬）物品添加到豬的掉落物中，機率為 100%：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"181\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd addhand &lt;實體名稱&gt; &lt;掉落機率&gt;</em> 指令。將生怪蛋（豬）物品添加到豬的掉落物中，機率為 50%：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"184\"></span><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd cleardrops &lt;實體名稱&gt;</em> 指令。清除先前設置的蛋。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"157\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>/cemd reload</em> 指令。手動修改 mobdropconfig 檔案後，更新掉落物。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"166\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>範例：</strong></span><br><span>一個將牛奶桶添加到牛死亡時掉落物的範例。使用 <em>/cemd addhand</em> 指令：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/g.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p>在牛身上測試：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/h.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p>哇！一個牛奶桶！<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/i.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p>位於 '<em>./config/configurableextramobdrops/mobdropconfig.txt</em>'。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>原版實體：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"581\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>以及來自例如 Animalium 的模組實體：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/k.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"357\"><br><span><strong>一個設定範例，讓殭屍村民有 50% 機率掉落一本寫好的書：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1265\" height=\"303\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>結果：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/m.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以自由地在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概述和更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
